{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-task-relay#card-zh","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-task-relay","commit":"de69deeee9071dd8fe7eb9e24deffe8adf668b20","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-relay 是一个适用于 DSH 的任务接力插件，通过向 DSH 工具注册表注册工具，在不同会话和子 agent 之间共享持久任务队列与交接摘要。它支持投递带标题、描述、优先级和标签的任务，按状态或条件查询任务，认领、完成或取消任务，也能为会话写入和读取交接摘要。数据保存在本机 JSON 文件中，适合需要让后续会话接续工作、分配待办并查看进展的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20","lib/tools.js:20","lib/store.js:33-36"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-task-relay#card-en","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-task-relay","commit":"de69deeee9071dd8fe7eb9e24deffe8adf668b20","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-task-relay registers DSH tools for a persistent task queue and session handoff notes. Users can create, filter, claim, complete, and cancel tasks, then write or read handoffs. Data stays in a local JSON file; no API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20","lib/tools.js:20","lib/store.js:33-36"]}
